&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Health &amp;amp; Wellness Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Better than your average startup healthcare benefits. With five options to choose from, of which are fully subsidized by HiddenLayer, we offer a variety of options to fit each person’s needs. We also offer vision, dental, and 401k offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
